<h4 id=3D"delete">Delete</h4>
<p>We have to remove hateful, violent, sexually explicit, or dangerous auto=
complete suggestions. We add a filter layer (Figure 14) in front of the Tri=
e Cache to filter out unwanted suggestions. Having a filter layer gives us =
the flexibility of removing results based on different filter rules. Unwant=
ed suggestions are removed physically from the database asynchronically so =
the correct data set will be used to build trie in the next update cycle.</=
p>
